{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Explore-Eng.jpg?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/hallwayv2.gif?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the school, piece together clues, and confront the entities that bind you to this endless day. Every loop reveals another piece of the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Anomalies-Eng.jpg?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/anomaliesgif.gif?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings closely, any subtle change will decide your next move. Some anomalies are minor, others far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/TEMP-GIF3.png?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you spot any anomalies, take the stairs down. Otherwise, if everything feels normal, head up. This will determine whether you escape or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1753649322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1753649322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/9adac6fe24b5074c22786ea09c6fcdfdeaecaba6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753649322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/9adac6fe24b5074c22786ea09c6fcdfdeaecaba6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753649322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Explore-Eng.jpg?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/hallwayv2.gif?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the school, piece together clues, and confront the entities that bind you to this endless day. Every loop reveals another piece of the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/H-Anomalies-Eng.jpg?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/anomaliesgif.gif?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe your surroundings closely, any subtle change will decide your next move. Some anomalies are minor, others far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/TEMP-GIF3.png?t=1753649322\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you spot any anomalies, take the stairs down. Otherwise, if everything feels normal, head up. This will determine whether you escape or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jakub T","4ydam"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/f2afbfb763edb7dcd2733d91af660ecffadb768e/header.jpg?t=1753649322","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257138710,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138710/movie480.mp4?t=1753649321","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138710/movie_max.mp4?t=1753649321"}